    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mfenced></math> where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> are real numbers. Which of the following options is/are correct?",
