  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> ...(i)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>8</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> ...(ii)<br />Option <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> :<br />Now from matrix <math><mi>M</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></math><br />As given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />Using the values of <math><mi>a</mi></math> and <math><mi>b</mi></math> in matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>|</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>|</mo><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math><br />Now, <math><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>M</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns